<aside class="shelter-sidebar" aria-labelledby="shelter-title">

  <h2 id="shelter-title">Ways to Find a Shelter</h2>

  <section>
    <h3>Text Message</h3>
    <p>
      Text <strong>SHELTER</strong> and your ZIP code to
      <strong>43362</strong>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>FEMA App</h3>
    <p>
      Use the FEMA App to find nearby emergency shelters and
      other disaster resources.
    </p>

    <a
      href="https://www.ready.gov/fema-app"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Download the FEMA App
    </a>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Online Resources</h3>
    <p>
      Visit DisasterAssistance.gov for disaster resources,
      assistance information, and shelter help.
    </p>

    <a
      href="https://www.disasterassistance.gov/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Visit DisasterAssistance.gov
    </a>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>What Shelters Provide</h3>

    <ul>
      <li>Safe seating or sleeping space away from danger</li>
      <li>Drinking water, food, and snacks</li>
      <li>Basic first aid supplies</li>
      <li>Restrooms</li>
      <li>Basic comfort items such as blankets</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="shelter-note">
      Services can vary by shelter, so check availability
      before traveling.
    </p>
  </section>

</aside>